#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:3
#: 2c2d4d2f42054bb1ba2395c042a1b29f
msgid "振动模态扰动（Vib Mode Perturb）"
msgstr "Vibrational-Mode Perturbation (Vib Mode Perturb)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:5
#: 8d7868e03ec64f0697c3343f55995161
msgid "`Group`: `Perturbation` | `Class`: `VibrationModePerturbCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:7
#: b8a70482c5e6458f92bf80121add18ca
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:9
#: f5ce60d81e334a6ea2352b8138c5f4b8
msgid "沿声子振动模态方向施加位移扰动，比纯随机扰动更贴近动力学自由度。每个输出结构随机选取若干振动模态，按幅值叠加位移。可选按频率缩放（高频模态贡献更小）和排除近零频模态（避免平移/旋转伪模）。"
msgstr ""
"Displace atoms along phonon eigenvectors so the sampled directions follow "
"dynamical degrees of freedom rather than arbitrary coordinate noise. Each "
"output combines a random subset of modes. Optional frequency scaling reduces"
" the contribution of high-frequency modes, and a near-zero-frequency filter "
"removes translational or rotational artifacts."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:11
#: 92e7c2b942f74fab971e14f98712be6e
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{r}'=\\mathbf{r}+A\\sum_{k\\in\\mathcal{K}} c_k\\mathbf{u}_k,\\quad "
"c_k\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,1)\\ \\text{or}\\ \\mathcal{U}(-1,1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:13
#: a2cdd00a642549d29a32e969bb9ce960
msgid ""
"**关键前置条件：** 输入结构必须携带振动模态数据。如果来自 EXTXYZ 文件，需要包含 `mode_N_x/y/z` 和 "
"`frequency_N` 列，或者整块数组 `modes` / `vibration_modes` 和 `frequencies` / "
"`vibration_frequencies`。没有模态数据时，卡片返回空结果。"
msgstr ""
"**Required input:** Every input structure must carry vibrational-mode data. "
"An EXTXYZ file may provide `mode_N_x/y/z` and `frequency_N` columns, or "
"block arrays named `modes` / `vibration_modes` and `frequencies` / "
"`vibration_frequencies`. A structure without recognized mode data is "
"skipped, so an all-missing input produces no output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:15
#: c4218acb4740499581c7c92e21b681f9
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:17
#: 6793c679785e4be196a9ec5a3d065d07
msgid "场景：加了 Atomic Perturb 后力 MAE 改善有限，低频声子支的预测仍然很差"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: Atomic Perturb improves force MAE only modestly and low-frequency "
"phonon branches remain inaccurate"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:19
#: f92552fd70b1434db418af377e17a17f
msgid ""
"你在 Si 上训练了一个 NEP 模型。加了 `Atomic Perturb`（0.2 Å 随机位移）后，力的 MAE 从 150 meV/A 降到了 "
"80 "
"meV/A，但计算出的声子色散在低频声学支上误差仍然很大。诊断发现：纯随机扰动在所有方向上均匀采样，但低频声子对应的是长波长的协同原子运动——纯随机扰动几乎不可能恰好对齐这些方向。"
msgstr ""
"You trained an NEP model for Si. Adding 0.2 Å `Atomic Perturb` samples "
"reduces force MAE from 150 to 80 meV/Å, yet the low-frequency acoustic "
"branches of the predicted phonon dispersion remain inaccurate. Independent "
"random displacements sample generic directions, whereas low-frequency "
"phonons involve collective, long-wavelength motion that random noise is "
"unlikely to align with efficiently."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:21
#: 9f0a329b01c74e4096f9deb218e6b7fc
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** "
"声子频率对位移的灵敏度在各个模态方向上差异巨大。低频声学模涉及大范围原子协同位移，但在局部键长上变化很小——纯随机扰动倾向于产生\"局域键长变化大\"的构型，这恰好是高频光学模的特征，不是低频模的特征。需要沿准确的振动模本征方向施加位移，让模型在模态坐标上也有训练点。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** The energy response differs greatly among normal-mode "
"directions. Low-frequency acoustic modes involve coordinated motion across "
"many atoms while changing local bond lengths only slightly. Independent "
"random perturbations emphasize local bond distortions and therefore cover "
"those collective directions poorly. Displacements along trusted eigenvectors"
" place training samples directly on the relevant normal-mode coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:23
#: 6072feed8b14498b922a39e890af1775
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个 Si 超胞，EXTXYZ 文件已包含 phonopy 计算出的振动模态数据（`mode_1_x/y/z` 到 "
"`mode_N_x/y/z` 和 `frequency_1` 到 `frequency_N`）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A Si supercell whose EXTXYZ data include phonopy-derived modes "
"(`mode_1_x/y/z` through `mode_N_x/y/z`) and frequencies (`frequency_1` "
"through `frequency_N`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:25
#: 8849fffcc91f42cdae548a486f37cf70
msgid "**目标：** 生成 32 个扰动结构，每次随机选 3 个模态叠加，幅值 0.05，只使用频率 > 10 THz 的模态（或 < 10 的具体看体系）"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Generate 32 perturbed structures by combining three randomly "
"selected modes per structure at amplitude 0.05. Choose a frequency threshold"
" appropriate to the system; for example, retain only modes above 10 THz when"
" intentionally targeting that range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:27
#: d77644f1007c4f1e8fc7dd4116f31aae
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:28
#: 2767967befb14f9c8d79c33e551f11b7
msgid "`amplitude` = `0.05`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:29
#: 94ebe78698764944bc569b1e3b887e1a
msgid "`modes_per_sample` = `3`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:30
#: 594c1394ddd543899211fff8ca5e5743
msgid "`max_num` = `32`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:31
#: e839f070d11a4a5caa34e35a5831acf8
msgid "`min_frequency` = `0.0` （或设一个合理的过滤值）"
msgstr "`min_frequency` = `0.0`, or a physically justified filtering threshold"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:32
#: 03976c15d80b430b9372a036704404ec
msgid "`distribution` = `0` （高斯分布）"
msgstr "`distribution` = `0` (Gaussian)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:33
#: d6061adf6f2c4878a1625643ec6697ec
msgid "`scale_by_frequency` = `true` （高频模自动衰减）"
msgstr "`scale_by_frequency` = `true` (automatically attenuate high-frequency modes)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:35
#: f7cd1eabbc5b4ac4bc26ae5029cf7380
msgid "**输出：** 32 个结构，每个沿 3 个随机选取的振动模态方向偏移，位移幅值按频率缩放"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** 32 structures displaced along combinations of three randomly "
"selected vibrational modes, with contributions scaled by frequency."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:37
#: 2aecafad948e43c48dd36cc455257a59
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:38
#: 98cef686be9849b9989e40e7de04ae1a
msgid "重训后重新计算声子色散，低频声学支应更接近 DFT 结果"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, recalculate the phonon dispersion and "
"compare the low-frequency acoustic branches with DFT."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:39
#: 7046baff3a3245bebeb57955753e7491
msgid "检查输出中哪些模态被选中——如果低频模态总是被 `min_frequency` 排除，降低此阈值"
msgstr ""
"Inspect which modes were selected. If relevant low-frequency modes are "
"excluded by `min_frequency`, lower the threshold."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:40
#: a98c4241bf4b492ea1b1e809076299a0
msgid "如果模型对高频光学支仍然不准，增大 `modes_per_sample` 到 4~5，或增大 `max_num`"
msgstr ""
"If high-frequency optical branches remain inaccurate, increase "
"`modes_per_sample` to 4–5 or raise `max_num`, then verify that the added "
"samples cover the intended modes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:41
#: 91c8498ff1274967a60e5607f0865dc4
msgid "如果 `scale_by_frequency` 导致高频模位移太小（几乎看不到变化），关闭此开关试一批"
msgstr ""
"If `scale_by_frequency` makes high-frequency displacements negligibly small,"
" generate a controlled comparison with scaling disabled and a "
"correspondingly reduced amplitude."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:43
#: e4fc057611b04e1ab7772ac700f4bc86
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:45
#: 17a3c23225e34668ad5a80a4945a95ae
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:46
#: 8a41a825b8bc4697a839afb8c9af015d
msgid "已有可信的振动模态数据，需要沿模态方向补充训练样本"
msgstr ""
"Trusted vibrational-mode data are available and the training set needs "
"samples along those directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:47
#: a2b9416503d8428596bd4bc9656dc8b4
msgid "纯随机扰动改进有限，声子或振动相关性质仍有偏差"
msgstr ""
"Random perturbations have provided limited improvement and phonon or "
"vibrational properties remain inaccurate."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:48
#: e3a3d721e8944caca4b8b0d06378bde2
msgid "需要模型学到模态方向上的势能面曲率"
msgstr ""
"The model needs potential-energy curvature information along normal-mode "
"coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:50
#: d77ada76a9b3410e8dc8cafbbdf1c325
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:51
#: 564e0131101c4c4eb6fd935c5639b363
msgid "输入结构没有模态数据——卡片直接返回空，先跑 phonopy/DFPT 生成模态"
msgstr ""
"The input has no mode data. Generate modes with phonopy or DFPT before using"
" this card."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:52
#: f5580119d74442169ed21fa20e9aa400
msgid "模态是从低精度方法（如经验势）算出来的——沿错误模态方向扰动只会引入噪声"
msgstr ""
"The modes come from an insufficiently accurate method. Sampling along "
"incorrect eigenvectors may add noise rather than useful coverage."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:53
#: 3b26b17d18d84e77b4cd2a260abade0e
msgid "只需要覆盖高频局域环境——用 `Atomic Perturb` 更简单直接"
msgstr ""
"Only generic high-frequency local distortions are needed → `Atomic Perturb` "
"is simpler."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:55
#: 1a4969360f8642e485bd9be7fe44ce64
msgid "输入格式：振动模态数据"
msgstr "Input format: vibrational-mode data"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:57
#: fcadc93628394d0ca08a925f6df4515b
msgid "输入结构需要以下数组之一（EXTXYZ 格式优先）："
msgstr ""
"The input structure must contain one of the following array layouts. EXTXYZ "
"is recommended."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:59
#: 1602d3a3129c49d48a02351300e80c77
msgid "**方式一：按模态拆列（推荐，手写最友好）**"
msgstr ""
"**Layout 1: one set of columns per mode (recommended and easiest to write "
"manually)**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:60
#: 63d7c44707014656b2e0f30d3e2c9ba3
msgid ""
"2\n"
"Properties=species:S:1:pos:R:3:mode_1_x:R:1:mode_1_y:R:1:mode_1_z:R:1:frequency_1:R:1"
" pbc=\"F F F\"\n"
"H 0.000 0.000 0.000 0.10 0.00 0.00 1500.0\n"
"H 0.740 0.000 0.000 -0.10 0.00 0.00 1500.0\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:66
#: 9779071de89f40ab970b9e1a98ad2400
msgid "`mode_N_x/y/z`：第 N 个模态在每个原子上的位移分量。`frequency_N`：第 N 个模态的频率，每个原子行重复同一值。"
msgstr ""
"`mode_N_x/y/z` stores the displacement components of mode *N* for each atom."
" `frequency_N` stores that mode's frequency, repeated on every atomic row."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:68
#: b1ec7e20d5bb4ad8952eca831881a03e
msgid "**方式二：整块数组（适合多模态）**"
msgstr "**Layout 2: block arrays (convenient for many modes)**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:69
#: e0f79f459c044a83800927d7a4d61ba6
msgid ""
"2\n"
"Properties=species:S:1:pos:R:3:modes:R:3N:frequencies:R:N pbc=\"F F F\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:73
#: 8f763c0d3642495f8918e7a5db532697
msgid ""
"`modes:R:3N` 表示 N 个模态的位移分量，按 mode1_xyz + mode2_xyz + ... "
"顺序。`frequencies:R:N` 表示 N 个频率值，每行重复同一组。"
msgstr ""
"`modes:R:3N` stores the displacement components of *N* modes in `mode1_xyz +"
" mode2_xyz + ...` order. `frequencies:R:N` stores the *N* frequency values, "
"with the same set repeated on each row."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:75
#: c59a241702e84c3aabccc1beb1240ce4
msgid ""
"代码接受的键名：`vibration_modes` / `normal_modes` / `modes`，以及 "
"`vibration_frequencies` / `normal_mode_frequencies` / `frequencies` / "
"`freqs`。列名或形状不对时，卡片将该结构视为\"没有可用模态\"并跳过。"
msgstr ""
"Accepted mode keys are `vibration_modes`, `normal_modes`, and `modes`; "
"accepted frequency keys are `vibration_frequencies`, "
"`normal_mode_frequencies`, `frequencies`, and `freqs`. A structure with "
"unrecognized names or incompatible shapes is treated as having no usable "
"modes and is skipped."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:77
#: 1e0781fb0d6f4b86ab2fc677f24b940e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:79
#: c831fc098ba64226b1baa83f7bec06d3
msgid "Distribution（distribution）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:81
#: a561d681ce7948a5b0556ce12fb5f71e
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0。模态系数的采样分布。`0` = 高斯（均值 0，大幅位移概率更低，更接近热振动统计）；`1` = "
"均匀。通常高斯更物理——你不希望模型被极端大位移的训练点带偏。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `0`. Distribution used to sample mode coefficients. `0` is a"
" zero-mean Gaussian, which makes extreme amplitudes less likely; `1` is "
"uniform. Gaussian sampling is usually the safer thermal-like default."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:83
#: 36dde7630ca84d38ac0e30a1575a864e
msgid "Amplitude（amplitude）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:85
#: 9b592e599d2b453f865f105d038af968
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.05`。模态叠加的总幅值系数，实际位移 = `amplitude * sum(coefficient * "
"mode_vector)`。注意这个幅值是乘在归一化后的模态矢量上的——如果上游的模态归一化方式不同（mass-weighted vs. "
"不归一化），同样的 amplitude 产生的实际原子位移也不一样。0.01~0.03 适合微扰验证；0.05~0.08 常规补充；设到 0.1 "
"以上建议后筛检查最近邻距离。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.05`. Overall coefficient in `displacement = amplitude *"
" sum(coefficient * mode_vector)`. The actual atomic displacement also "
"depends on how the upstream mode vectors were normalized, including whether "
"they are mass weighted. Use 0.01–0.03 for small-displacement checks and "
"0.05–0.08 for routine augmentation. Above 0.1, validate nearest-neighbor "
"distances carefully."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:87
#: fc7d1e1a1f7148ffa152a0ece0375204
msgid "Modes Per Sample（modes_per_sample）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:89
#: 8892b9368d8f4023ad53e53df04d54f9
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 2。每个输出结构随机选几个模态来叠加。1~2 个适合单模态方向验证，能清楚看到每个模态的贡献；3~4 个做多模态混合覆盖；5 "
"个以上单个模态的贡献会被稀释，而且组合数指数增长——通常 2~4 就够了。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `2`. Number of randomly selected modes combined in each "
"output. Use 1–2 to inspect individual-mode behavior and 3–4 for mixed-mode "
"coverage. Above 5, each mode's contribution becomes harder to interpret and "
"the combinatorial space grows rapidly; 2–4 is usually sufficient."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:91
#: fa49cbde986c455782ceaea103af16c3
msgid "Min Frequency（min_frequency）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:93
#: 48bdbf8092924e34b800098e0d9de695
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `10.0`。频率低于这个值的模态不参与采样。仅在 `exclude_near_zero=true` 时生效。设 0 "
"则不过滤。典型值：排除平移/旋转伪模设 0.1~1.0 THz；排除软模设 1~10 THz，具体看你的体系。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `10.0`. Modes below this frequency are excluded when "
"`exclude_near_zero=true`; use 0 to disable thresholding. A 0.1–1.0 THz "
"threshold can remove translational or rotational artifacts, while 1–10 THz "
"also removes soft modes. Choose the value from the calculated spectrum and "
"the physics you intend to retain."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:95
#: b3e01b25152c4921bb4785d35a1e5b33
msgid "Max Num（max_num）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:97
#: 61b78d88d22f4622b9b4a6c198a28339
msgid "`int`，默认 32。每个输入结构生成多少个扰动样本。20~40 常规覆盖，50~100 高密度覆盖。建议后面接一张 `FPS Filter` 去重。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `32`. Number of perturbed samples generated per input "
"structure. Use 20–40 for routine coverage and 50–100 for denser sampling. "
"Follow large batches with `FPS Filter` to reduce redundancy."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:99
#: d5153a35070141c5943ab8e91f9ce080
msgid "Scale BY Frequency（scale_by_frequency）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:101
#: 23a7f99b78994328816138dc5fe96280
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后每个模态系数除以 "
"sqrt(frequency)，高频模态的贡献自动衰减。这是物理上更合理的设置——同样的位移幅值，高频模态需要的能量远大于低频模。如果你在研究大位移的非谐效应，可以临时关掉，但注意关掉后高频模方向可能被过度采样，建议同时降低"
" `amplitude`。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `true`. Divides each mode coefficient by `sqrt(frequency)`,"
" attenuating high-frequency contributions. This is a useful thermal-like "
"default because high-frequency modes are energetically expensive at equal "
"displacement. When intentionally studying large-amplitude anharmonicity, you"
" may disable it, but reduce `amplitude` to avoid over-sampling high-"
"frequency directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:103
#: f4c6c4a6ce0f421797dcb902a3f1a923
msgid "Exclude Near Zero（exclude_near_zero）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:105
#: 71300820c4004c0bbdfef2aa2ddbd104
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后用 `min_frequency` 做阈值过滤，排除近零频模态。一般建议保持打开——平移和旋转伪模的频率接近 "
"0，沿这些\"模态\"做位移会产生异常大的整体漂移。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `true`. Applies `min_frequency` to remove near-zero modes. "
"Keep it enabled in most workflows because translational and rotational "
"artifacts lie near zero frequency and can produce large rigid-body drift."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:107
#: 52abbc4ded384aeba71e0fb64bf16603
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:109
#: 62db6f0470e24273a8efb31be2044f62
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `false`。打开后每次同一输入 + 同一参数 + 同一 seed "
"得到完全相同的扰动结果。对比实验或需要复现时打开，纯探索阶段可以关着。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `false`. Enable it to reproduce exactly the same "
"perturbations from the same input, parameters, and seed. Use it for "
"controlled comparisons; leave it off during exploratory sampling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:111
#: 75660e0488a14cb9aecced0b38ea16c4
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:113
#: bdda0c7f1fa24ee89ea47f111291cc36
msgid "`int`，默认 0。随机种子值。仅在 `use_seed` 打开时生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default: `0`. Random seed used only when `use_seed` is enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:115
#: d33a4bccc2b24c4e9e29b013fe10b546
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:117
#: 526497dc66944734a09824b26c767309
